OL,3,GNEWSABirthday party for capybara who
OL,4,Aescaped from zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA birthday party is to be held for a
OL,7,Fcapybara who became world famous after
OL,8,Fescaping from a zoo.
OL,10,FCinnamon's third birthday will be
OL,11,Fmarked by staff at Hoo Zoo near
OL,12,FTelford, two years after the intrepid
OL,13,Frodent left her enclosure after a gate
OL,14,Fwas accidentally left open.
OL,16,FShe spent a week "living her best life"
OL,17,Fbefore zoo staff waded into a pond in a
OL,18,Fnearby conservation area to try and
OL,19,Fcoax her home. Her adventures sparked
OL,20,Fworld-wide news coverage and her story
OL,21,Fbecame the theme of a children's book.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
